# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# Fire seen through leaded glass: a cellular pattern as a `mask`, its bright
# cell centres letting the flames through and its dark seams blacking them out.
# Control overrides pick the mask's look — Style 2, pale floes split by dark
# cracks, 10 cells — and its ramp is a contrast curve, so a pane is clear glass.
S - Stained-Glass Fire
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Fire
I @pat/perlin-fire
C sliderFlameHeightPct 6553600
L pat 0 0 0 0 mask 100 none fill 1
N Leading
I @pat/voronoi-2d
C sliderStyle 131072
C sliderCells 655360
R 100 0:000000 110:ffffff
